{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The removable picture hanging strips partly fit my recent interest in hooks because they offer another way to hang things without permanent fastening.",
    "The hardware supplies reflect my recent interest in practical fastening tasks, although none addresses a clear enough need for me to choose it now."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Wire lugs, electrical testers, electrical tape and heat shrink supplies require a wiring task that my recent hooks, washers and bolts do not suggest.",
    "Drywall screws serve a different purpose from metric machine screws and locking washers; being fasteners alone does not make them useful to me now.",
    "A farm jack does not follow from my hand truck purchase, and bulk trash bags do not help with the hanging and small hardware needs reflected in my recent activity."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The recommendations seem to treat general workshop usefulness as a reason I would need an item now.",
    "Buying hardware assortments seems to have been taken as interest in bulk supplies for unrelated jobs."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My two recent magnetic hook purchases suggest a more specific interest in convenient hanging solutions, especially for magnetic surfaces.",
    "The purpose and fit of each fastener matter to me: metric bolts and push-on washers do not imply a need for drywall screws or battery cable connectors.",
    "I rarely act without a relevant immediate need; even the hanging strips would need a specific picture-mounting task before I would buy them."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my interest in practical hardware but stretched it into unrelated electrical, lifting and bulk supply needs."
}"}
